### Background

This repro is a simplification of the repro provided in https://github.com/hex-inc/vegafusion/issues/361.

This chart renders in Vega because Vega seems to ignore columns that don't exist as groupby fields in the window transform.  VegaFusion currently raises an error in this case.  I'm going to update VegaFusion to match Vega's behavior here, but wanted to raise an issue because I think there's an error somewhere here in Vega-Lite.

